L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E51G

   1 a 0000 E51G:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-51/P1] QUOTIENT RIGHT of an add: z = c + a / b.  [C141]
   4 a 0006      P1 evaluates the call RIGHT side FIRST for var + call, so H-G-
   5 a 0006      same predicts G byte-identical to F modulo relocs already
   6 a 0006      identical (same order a, b, c): <div> / XCHG / LHLD c / DAD D
   7 a 0006      / SHLD z.  H-G-leftfirst evaluates c into DE first (LHLD c /
   8 a 0006      XCHG after the div would then carry DIFFERENT bytes); a
   9 a 0006      difference between F and G falsifies orientation-free right-
  10 a 0006      first evaluation for DIV operands. */
  11 c 0006   dcl a fixed, b fixed, c fixed, z fixed;
  12 c 0006   z = c + a / b;
  13 a 0019 end E51G;

CODE SIZE = 001C
DATA AREA = 0008
FREE SYMS = 38BC
END  COMPILATION
